    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, you earn the favor of a spirit beast and are able to assume its spectral visage. Choose a Medium or Small beast without a fly or swim speed to represent your spirit.</p><p>You can use your action to assume the illusionary visage of your spirit beast. This visage has no effect on your game statistics except changing your movement speed to 50 feet.</p><p>You remain transformed until you cast a spell, make an attack, or use your bonus action to revert back to yourself.</p>",
